WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.614
When a donor needs a break after office hours, a small nonprofit should be able to complete the request and show what happened. This is Pledge Line.

2
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:19.567
This is the working browser app using PayPal's sandbox. The PIN is masked. Only test funds are involved; this shared demo PIN is not production identity.

3
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:32.878
The donor asks to pause. The line reads PayPal, proposes the exact change, and waits for a separate yes. PayPal then confirms the gift is suspended.

4
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:43.578
Restart needs a new proposal and fresh consent. The earlier yes cannot approve another operation. The line executes the accepted request, then reads PayPal back.

5
00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:49.600
PayPal confirms the gift is active.

6
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:54.128
Ending the call creates a signed receipt with the spoken claims and the provider reads behind them.

7
00:00:54.200 --> 00:01:01.814
Editorial cut. The export helper failed after the call ended. We continue read only with the same receipt. Neither financial action is repeated.

8
00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:06.682
The original signed file verifies.

9
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:17.834
Here, one sentence was edited. The checker identifies exactly sentence one. This actual screen is held briefly for reading.

10
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.078
The signature proves what this app signed. It is not a PayPal signature or a guarantee of live settlement.

11
00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:35.751
The supply desk helps the coordinator buy one hundred white cotton volunteer shirts within eight hundred dollars. The buyer permits splitting the order, but initially gives only a delivery date.

12
00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:56.393
The agent asks for the missing clock time. Five PM Pacific completes the deadline while keeping the earlier quantity, budget, goods and split permission. The limits are editable and source backed.

13
00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:06.527
Only Find a plan contacts suppliers. Anthropic proposes bounded counteroffers. Jev offers quick routing and advisory review; deterministic checks enforce payment permissions.

14
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:23.298
Three authenticated MCP lab suppliers return complete prices. Code checks quantity, delivery, specifications, merchant, setup, shipping and tax. These are controlled suppliers, not independent businesses or real fulfillment.

15
00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:32.479
The exact plan still needs explicit buyer approval, then approval of each PayPal order. A suggestion, a warning, or a status check cannot authorize payment.

16
00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:49.271
This read only view shows the price guard. Code selects six hundred seventy four dollars fifteen cents, below the AI candidate at six hundred seventy six dollars twenty five. This is protection, not AI price superiority. Sandbox only.

